      "the chase turns around, and now they are the ones chasing",
      "somebody gets hurt, and it changes what the whole group can do",
      "the shortcut everyone knows about is the trap",
      "the weather closes the only road out",
      "someone who should not be there refuses to leave",
      "the plan means splitting up, and everyone knows how that ends",
      "a bystander gets caught in it and cannot be got out",
      "the clock they were all working to turns out to be wrong",
      "the strongest one goes down first",
